  "description": "AJUVAG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C62 H92 N4 Nd4 O22. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.829-4.043 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.64-111.20°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C62H92N4Nd4O22. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
